abstract: >-
  Data and code for the attraction law of rating revisions under social pressure in
  Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct: per-item ratings without pressure and under critical or
  laudatory pressure (30 items x 10 generations per arm, then 40 items x 5 generations
  in three prompt strata), judged by claude-opus-4-6, with the script that refits the
  gain, the two targets and the fit and cross-validation R^2.
